00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Small businesses are
the lifeblood of this city

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:32.399
Reasonably priced produce is
the lifeblood of this city

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:36.236
The passing of Archbishop
Sheehan is the lifeblood -

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:36.870 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You're killing me.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:40.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, the comms department may
be stretched a little thin

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.641 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Why, thank you.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.176 line:92%
-Please welcome back to the show

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
