Bobby Moynihan.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.747 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
How are you, Bobby?

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.349 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Bobby? Oh, no.

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:53.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, no, Fred got to Bobby,
you guys.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.654 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-My Fred bit.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.122 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-How are you, my friend?

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good. How are you, sir?
-I'm good.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.393
So, you're actually in a trailer
right now.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.628 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You guys are shooting?

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:04.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
