I just moved in.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:04.898 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's very nice.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:08.101 size:88% position:44%
Yeah, no, we're shooting
episode nine right now.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:11.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Episode nine.
And I think when you think o

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:15.008
