00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
the second episode,
that's a fairly long time.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:20.146
But then you guys had it
stretched out even longer

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:20.780 size:88% position:44% line:92%
because of the pandemic.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
How long have you been working
on Season 1 of this show?

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:27.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
