00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:44.838
And it felt like a reunion for
a show that hasn't aired yet

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:46.272 line:92%
-And from that clip, I mean,

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:48.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's some real heavy hitter
in there, Bobby.

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.777 line:92%
Holly Hunter and Ted Danson.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.512 size:84% position:42% line:92%
How's that been so far?

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
