the nicest human in the world.

00:01:55.682 --> 00:02:00.186
And watching Holly Hunter
do anything is the best.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:00.920 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I'm in love with her.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:04.457
She's this big and I want to
carry her around on my shoulder.

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:05.024 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:07.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How is sitcom life
versus "SNL"?

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:10.730
You always had such a good eye
for sort of everyday weirdoe

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you would see
and then use as inspiration.

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:17.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it different now that
you're just playing one man?

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:21.608 line:92%
-Yes. We know our own, Seth.

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:23.343 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yes.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.444 line:92%
I play Jayden Kwapis in this

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:29.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think he's enough of a weird
for all of my "SNL" needs

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.750 line:92%
