00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.085 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm very happy.

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:35.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Jayden Kwapis
is a fantastic name.

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:36.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Not so bad.

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.724 line:92%
-A Carlock and Tina Fey --

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:39.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
A Robert Carlock
and Tina Fey special,

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:42.896
which leads to a great joke in
the pilot about the name Jayden.

00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:44.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, Bobby,
I don't need to tell you

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:48.468
you've long been a lover o
crazy names for characters

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:50.937 size:81% position:41%
