I'm no James Anderson.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:53.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
James Anderson makes up
the best names in the world,

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:56.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I am a fan of insane names
yes.

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:59.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
-These are just some character
you played on "SNL."

00:02:59.546 --> 00:03:01.981 line:92%
We collected a li-- Riblet

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:02.582 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Correct.

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:06.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You played Ass Dan
and his identical twin brother

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:09.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
